            <ArticleTitle>Protein-losing enteropathy in a young African-American woman with abdominal pain, diarrhea and hydronephrosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>835-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The case of a 21-year-old African-American woman who presented with abdominal pain, diarrhea and hydronephrosis and who proved to have protein-losing enteropathy secondary to systemic lupus erythematosus is discussed. This is an unusual complication of lupus.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
